
Algebraic Identities
======================================

.. math::

   (1+x)^2 &=& 1+2x+x^2

   (a+b)^2 &=& a^2+2ab+b^2

.. math::

   (1-x)^2 &=& 1-2x+x^2

   (a-b)^2 &=& a^2-2ab+b^2

.. math::

   (1-x)(1+x) &=& 1-x^2

   (a-b)(a+b) &=& a^2-b^2

.. math::

   1+x &=&\frac{x^2-1}{x-1}

   1+x+x^2 &=&\frac{x^3-1}{x-1}

   1+x+x^2+x^3 &=&\frac{x^4-1}{x-1}

   1+x+...+x^n &=&\frac{x^n-1}{x-1}
   
   

   
   
   
   

